{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_01_beg","storyGroup":"act44side","storySort":2,"storyDependence":"act44side_level_act44side_st01","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AT-1","storyName":"极道作风","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"御机的刑警惟任认为星熊应对二十年前的一场命案负责，但这件案子的追诉期已经过了，星熊回御机也只是因为情同养父的黑道——金石会会长铁斋的一封信。警察一筹莫展之际，金石会的三船光平找上警局，把星熊捞了出去。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act44side/level_act44side_01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act44side_01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["值班警察","刑警","星熊","惟任刑警","文月","金兵卫？","三船"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":4},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":5,"musicid":0},{"type":"dialogue","name":"值班警察","text":"刑警，炸肉排饭到了。","id":6},{"type":"dialogue","name":"刑警","text":"辛苦。你先回去吧。","id":7},{"type":"dialogue","name":"值班警察","text":"是！","id":8},{"type":"dialog","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"刑警","text":"已经半夜了，你从下午进入御机就在躲我们的人，一口吃的也没混到，肯定饿了吧。","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"（点头）","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"刑警","text":"那先吃饭吧。东国的炸肉排饭。","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plateplace","volume":"1","id":16},{"type":"text","text":"刑警特意强调了“东国”两个字，把餐盘推给星熊。","id":17},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pickupchopsticks","volume":"1","id":18},{"type":"text","text":"星熊一言不发地拿起深碗，抓起筷子，开始大口扒饭。","id":19},{"type":"dialog","id":20},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_64_i01.png","screenadapt":"coverall","x":"150","id":23},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.3","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"60","xTo":"0","id":24},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"刑警","text":"怎么样，龙门有这东西吗？","id":27},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_dishes","volume":"1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"（闷头扒饭）","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"刑警","text":"看你这副样子，到底有多长时间没吃过家乡菜了？","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"（往嘴里塞肉排）","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"刑警","text":"......算了，你先吃。","id":32},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humaneat","volume":"1","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"（咯吱咯吱地嚼卷心菜）","id":34},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","volume":"1","text":"","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"（喝水）","id":36},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_dishes","volume":"1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"（把整个深碗端起来仰头往嘴里扒）","id":38},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":40},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"2","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":41},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plateplace","volume":"1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"（放下空空如也的深碗）","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"呼。","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"刑警","text":"怎么样，怀念吗？","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"报告刑警，不是怀念，我就是饿了。","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"刑警","text":"你——","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"其实我从龙门出发前就吃的炸肉排饭。下次能请我吃点别的吗？比如你们把我抓走那地方的关东煮？闻起来那么香，汤我都没喝上一口。","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"还有，顺带一提，我在龙门自掏腰包请嫌疑人吃饭的时候都是吃肠粉的。","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"刑警","text":"态度放端正点，星熊嫌疑人。","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"嫌疑人？我才来御机不到二十四小时，我的嫌疑是什么？","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"刑警","text":"二十年前的嫌疑人就不是嫌疑人了吗？","id":52},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":54},{"type":"charslot","id":55},{"type":"image","id":56},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_bg_offce.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":57},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":61},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......刑警先生。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"刑警","text":"我姓惟任。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"惟任刑警。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"说。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"二十年，我的追诉期已经过了。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"再说，我在龙门的督察证现在也应该确认得差不多了吧。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"结果还没出。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"就当你说的是真的好了，那到底是什么风，能把一位龙门警察吹回来？","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"你失业了？你有仇家要对付？","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"龙门有什么人派你来的？","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"还是说，你跟最近城里在传的北院间谍有关系？","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"停停停，你再这么猜下去，事情就大条了。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"刑警，看看这封信吧。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"刚刚已经搜过一遍，你身上居然还藏着东西？","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"警察最懂警察。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"......","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":92},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","id":93},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"charslot","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":97},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":98},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_bg_bg_lungmenbridge.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"playsound","key":"$motorbikestart","volume":"0.6","id":101},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"35","randomness":"45","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":102},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","volume":"0.6","id":103},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"25","randomness":"45","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":105},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tech_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_sys_tech_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":106,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","duration":"0.5","id":107},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"呼。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"再跑一圈，怎么样，伙计，还撑得住吗？","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"35","randomness":"45","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":112},{"type":"playsound","key":"$motorbikestart","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":114},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"0.5","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#11$1","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"看来还成。那就走吧。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":118},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":119},{"type":"playsound","key":"$motorbikestart","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":121},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_enginerun","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.4","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#5$1","duration":"0.5","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"（是夫人的车？）","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":128},{"type":"playsound","key":"$motorbikestart","id":129},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":130},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"独角的鬼把整个身体伏在车上，看准了直道结束的位置，笔直地朝前冲去。","id":132},{"type":"text","text":"咆哮的风几乎让她看不清追赶者的距离——","id":133},{"type":"dialog","id":134},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":135},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1","id":136},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","volume":"0.6","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"夫人怎么停车了？","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"来凑个热闹而已，没打算一决高下。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"听彦吾说，出发去新汐斯塔前，诗怀雅将局内事务打理得井井有条，免得给你们这些留守的增添压力。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"是啊。要不是Missy临走前把事情处理得干净利落，没给我留什么负担，我怎么能抽出时间来这儿呢。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"也是。那还有什么事能让星熊督察烦心？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......难道都写在我脸上了？","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"倒也没有。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"不过，若是反反复复将油门踩到底，心情却总也无法平复，那就不该一个人憋着。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"偏偏小陈和诗怀雅都不在，只好由我这个同乡来越俎代庖了。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"同乡......是吗？","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"没错，同乡。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"真是瞒不过夫人。我最近收到了一封信......","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":165},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"1","id":166},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":167},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":169},{"type":"sticker","id":170,"text":"拜启","x":"200","y":"130","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700"},{"type":"sticker","id":171,"text":"时值夏末，残暑尚在，切盼珍重身体。二十年久疏问候，此间情状种种，信以不写为佳，然仍提笔叨扰，实在不胜惭愧。","multi":"true","x":"200","y":"200","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":172,"text":"\\n此次写信，非为别事，特因你我共度十数年之故土，锻冶町，即将不存于世。","x":"300","y":"300","alignment":"left","multi":"true","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":173,"text":"\\n地虽无知，人犹有情，是以不揣鄙陋，窃为锻冶町举丧，不日即将实行。","x":"300","y":"340","alignment":"left","multi":"true","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":174,"text":"\\n老朽风烛残年，若届时能得见故人一面，实乃大幸。","x":"300","y":"380","alignment":"left","size":"24","multi":"true","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":175,"text":"敬具","x":"200","y":"580","alignment":"right","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","multi":"true","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":176,"text":"\\n铁斋","x":"200","y":"510","alignment":"right","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","multi":"true","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":177,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":178,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":179,"duration":"1"},{"type":"dialog","id":180},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"好郑重的——不，守旧的写法。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"这位就是当年安排星熊督察来龙门避祸的，般若的“父亲”？","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B5/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"没错，我叫他铁斋叔。这么多年过去，他也该七八十岁了。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"而锻冶町，就是我离开御机之前住的地方。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"既然如此，在锻冶町“即将不存”的时候回去一趟，难道不是应有之义？","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B5/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......实话说，当年我来龙门时，想过在这里长居，想过混不下去之后去其他地方，甚至像离开东国一样离开大炎，唯独没想过回去。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"二十年过去，我都不知道御机现在成了什么样子，比起回去，不如来这里骑车，完事再去街边吃一碟炒粉来得安心。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"理由不是已经来了吗？一场葬礼，正好回家看看。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"你自愿成为龙门最坚固的盾，为此奋不顾身，彦吾、我、林，还有你那些朋友们，我们都看在眼里。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B5/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"但你本不应局限于此。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B5/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"小陈走了，雨霞多半接她父亲的班。只靠一个近卫局局长，这个摊子是支不起来的。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B5/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"是我对自己的职务多有怠慢——","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"别这么说。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B5/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"小陈离开龙门之前，你跟她说过一些话。不管我愿意还是不愿意，这些话终究会传到我的耳朵里。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"哪怕你压抑着的那些东西已经永远不能解决，就算只是回去看看，去和尚在人世的人聊一聊，总归也是好的。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B5/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......是。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"还有，回来时记得给我带几包东国的甜酱油煎饼。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"煎饼？","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1645_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"近卫局附近新开了家煎饼店，我以为是东国风味，就去店里点了一单。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"文月","text":"直到热腾腾的煎饼裹着香喷喷的羽兽卵液、炸肉和葱段端上来，我才意识到，这煎饼不是东国的，是姜齐的。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1645_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":222},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"charslot","id":225},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":228},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#1$1","id":229},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_bg_offce.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":230},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":232},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":233,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我想这下误会应该都解除了吧，惟任刑警。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"黑道组织“金石会”的会长给你写了封信，让你参加他盘踞的锻冶町的葬礼。在你同乡的劝说下，你下定决心回来，是这样吗？","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"没错。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"那位同乡——","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"她是谁不重要。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"不重要吗？如果不是你的那位好同乡，你真的敢大摇大摆地出现在御机街上？","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我当然敢。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"......","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"既然不重要，那你就在这里待满二十四小时再走。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"反正警局现在也清闲，每天打来的报警电话没几个是真有事。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"那他们打电话干嘛？","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"报告自己发现了怪谈的线索，让我们去查个究竟。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......怪谈？","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"哈，看来你倒是真有许多年没回过御机了。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"警察局现在根本没个警察局的样子，那些无聊人士早就把我们当成了灵务局——","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"谁？","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":268},{"type":"charslot","id":269},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":270},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1915_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":272},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"值班警察","text":"外面有人找，是......三船先生。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_1915_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":277},{"type":"text","text":"一脸劳碌相的刑警看看星熊，又看了看门外，脸上露出明显的愤恨。","id":278},{"type":"charslot","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1915_1#1$1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"值班警察","text":"要是您这边正在紧要关头，我去帮您拖一会儿？","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_1915_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"你拖得住他？你还没跟他说三句话，他就会给别人打电话，然后电话就会打到我们这儿。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1915_1#1$1","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"值班警察","text":"......","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_1915_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"叫他进——","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":293},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":294},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"charslot","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":300},{"type":"text","text":"刑警的话还没说完，一位身材高大的斐迪亚已经大步走进房间，对身旁的警察视若无睹，直接来到了星熊身旁。","id":301},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#9$1","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"金兵卫？！","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#4$1","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"金兵卫？","text":"星熊，别担心，有我在这儿，警察奈何不了你。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#3$1","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"（干笑）哈，哈。三船光平先生，有人叫你发迹之前的原名，是不是也久违了？","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"不如你也来叫一声如何，惟任刑警？","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#2$1","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"......","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"对的，识时务是好事。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"三船——","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"星熊，在你面前，我永远都是金兵卫。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"走，我们这就回家。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1915_1#1$1","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"值班警察","text":"惟任先生还没——","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_1915_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"还没什么？还没跟我讲清楚，警察有什么权力胡乱抓人？难道是为了二十年前那起案子？","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"不巧，追诉期已经过了，而且过了好几年。北院修改了追诉制度，不代表南院的警察也可以学他们肆意妄为。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1915_1#1$1","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"值班警察","text":"少在这里血口喷人，哪怕过了追诉期——","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_1915_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"过了追诉期，警察还有什么资格把人扣在这里？给我个理由，经得住议员质询，电视直播，民意拷问的理由。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1915_1#1$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"值班警察","text":"这是恐吓！","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_1915_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"这是我行使权利的方式。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1915_1#1$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"值班警察","text":"惟任先生！","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_npc_1915_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1898_1#1$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惟任刑警","text":"......放他们走。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_npc_1898_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......金兵卫，铁斋叔派你来接我？","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"整个金石会都等着你回来呢。走吧，别和这帮子警察纠缠了。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":344},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":345},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.8","delay":"0.15","channel":"b","id":346},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":347},{"type":"dialog","id":348},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":349},{"type":"charslot","id":350},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":351},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_sunshine_upperedge","layer":"2","x":"0","y":"-200","id":352},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.25","block":"true","id":353},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.25","block":"true","id":354},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_bg_64_g1_jindastreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","id":355},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"-150","yTo":"-80","xFrom":"0","xTo":"0","duration":"45","id":356},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":357},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":358,"musicid":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":359},{"type":"text","text":"走出警局，出门右转，过一条街。","id":360},{"type":"text","text":"白天的仁田街赫然出现在星熊面前。","id":361},{"type":"text","text":"无机质的白色日光平淡地洒满整条街道，混凝土的建筑外墙失去霓虹的辉映，现出原本的颜色。","id":362},{"type":"text","text":"正是上班时分，面无表情的上班族们行色匆匆，经过要么还没开业，要么仍在揽客，却已经失去了夜色中的光鲜的大小商店。","id":363},{"type":"text","text":"昨晚是谁在街头大吐特吐，又是谁在劝诱下一掷千金，此刻早已无法分辨。","id":364},{"type":"dialog","id":365},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":367},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":368},{"type":"bgeffect","id":369},{"type":"curtain","id":370},{"type":"delay","time":"0.25","id":371},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_bg_64_g1_jindastreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":375},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","duration":"1","id":376},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"好多年没见到你了！你在龙门怎么样，还好吗？这么多年音信不通，我真怕你在那边出了什么事，我都要担心死了！","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"我还以为这么多年过去，自己已经不算金石会的人了。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"这是哪儿的话。哪怕命运捉弄，音讯不通，只要你回来，就是我们的家人。","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"二十年来，金石会可曾发出过任何将你“破门”或者“绝缘”的通告？从来没有。","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"别的不说，直到现在，开大会的时候，老爷子左手边位置一直都是空着的。你一直是整个金石会的若头。接班人。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"那你......？","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"若头补佐而已。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"千万别觉得老爷子糊涂。他这么做，所有人都是服气的。","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"二十年前，如果不是你挺身而出，抢在我前面杀死了那位议员候选人，整个金石会都会被赶出锻冶町，在他的舆论攻势之下粉身碎骨。","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"在那之后，你又把我们这些人摘了出去，自己一个人担负了杀人的重责，远遁龙门，才让金石会得以存续。","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"你为我们做出了这么大的牺牲，我们要是一转头就把你抛弃掉，那我们还算人吗？","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"......别这么说。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"这都是清清楚楚的事实，我怎么能不这么说？","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"金兵卫，旧事可以等会儿再聊。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"星熊","text":"铁斋叔在信上说他要给锻冶町举办葬礼，这件事，他跟你透露过吗？","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_136_hsguma_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"葬礼？！","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"葬礼......不，那怎么会是一场葬礼呢？","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1896_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三船","text":"鬼姐，这下我们真没时间在街上东游西逛了。我们赶紧回锻冶町，赶紧找到他，把事情讲清楚。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2F/Avg_avg_npc_1896_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":408},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":409},{"type":"text","text":"高大的斐迪亚加快了脚步，急匆匆地朝着锻冶町的方向走去。","id":410},{"type":"text","text":"他步子迈得那么大，那么急，以至于星熊不得不小跑着追上去。","id":411},{"type":"dialog","id":412},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":413},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":414},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":415},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":416},{"type":"image","id":417},{"type":"charslot","id":418}],"characters":["值班警察","刑警","星熊","惟任刑警","文月","金兵卫？","三船"]}